0..71 Comment "//! `buffer-moved` transfers an owned buffer to a mock ring submission."
72..75 Comment "//!"
76..152 Comment "//! A submission owns its buffer until its completion. The pathological twin"
153..225 Comment "//! refuses the old owner when it closes the buffer as `UsedAfterClose`."
226..229 Comment "//!"
230..309 Comment "//! The checker consumes the owner\'s endpoint at `send`. The mock kernel closes"
310..356 Comment "//! the buffer before it posts the completion."
357..360 Comment "//!"
361..423 Comment "//! - see: corpus/pathological/completion/buffer-touched.gandr"
424..469 Comment "//! - see: https://doi.org/10.1007/BFb0053567"
470..517 Comment "//! - see: https://without.boats/blog/io-uring/"
519..558 Comment "// The ring\'s protocol and its entries."
