588..666 Comment "/// A buffer moved into the mock kernel\'s submission and finished there before"
667..743 Comment "/// the completion is posted: the send consumes the submitter\'s end, and the"
744..801 Comment "/// kernel\'s receive binds it until the kernel closes it."
